  "posts": [
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ohio can\u2019t afford to trust Amy Acton again. She owes our state an apology.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044243702231773319",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T02:37:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There would have never been a First Amendment, without the Second Amendment. Tonight I explained why.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044237310720651352",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T02:12:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Honored to receive the endorsement today from the Buckeye Firearms Association, representing gun owners across Ohio. We will always stand for the Second Amendment. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044225671027929230",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T01:25:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The government we elect is the government we deserve.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044138912931819748",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T19:41:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Second Amendment isn\u2019t a suggestion, it\u2019s a right. And it\u2019s the one that secures all the others.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044085192667832483",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T16:07:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Proud to back the blue in Ohio. Grateful for our men and women in uniform. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2043885553851195743",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T02:54:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There\u2019s nothing more beautiful than a proud mom. What a great American story. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2043739017779523985",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T17:12:07+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We will always stand for our veterans &amp; we need to implement practical solutions to better serve them. Properly transitioning back to civilian life with job retraining is part of the answer.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2043451459220738504",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T22:09:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Second Amendment wasn\u2019t a suggestion. It\u2019s a guaranteed right for a reason. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2043019360311349335",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T17:32:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019ll always support our veterans, period. Fun visit last night to grab some drinks at the VFW Post in Mason, not far from where I grew up.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042952932052836448",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T13:08:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "You just might recognize a few friends from our visit to Warren County tonight\u2026including one rightfully proud American mom. @JDVance \u2764\ufe0f",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042756740643721434",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T00:08:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We need to bring economic development &amp; high-paying jobs to Ohio, and we need to do it on the terms of local communities. Those aren\u2019t in tension, they go together.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042623798986576176",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T15:20:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The government we elect is the government we deserve. Get out &amp; VOTE, starting now in the primary.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042618107668369910",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T14:58:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Shall Not Be Infringed.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042384967758725544",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T23:31:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank you \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffd\n\n\u201cThe NRA Political Victory Fund is proud to endorse Vivek Ramaswamy for Governor of Ohio. Across America, radical progressive groups are waging an all-out war on the Second Amendment. Now, more than ever, gun owners must engage in the political process to defend our God-given rights. Vivek Ramaswamy has proven himself a fierce, unwavering champion of the Second Amendment, and Ohioans can trust that he will stand as an ironclad defender of their right to keep and bear arms.\u201d -John C",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042383242796654998",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T23:24:45+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs. Bigger paychecks. Better schools. Coming soon to Cleveland &amp; across Ohio.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042220391306010835",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T12:37:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019m proud to back the blue in Ohio, so grateful for our men &amp; women in uniform. Strong visit to the Cleveland Police Patrolmen\u2019s Association.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2042011282149404832",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:46:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great to have an unfiltered conversation at our town hall in Geauga County at Ohio Ordnance Works, where Ohio workers are building world-class firearms to support those who serve our country. Grateful to all of the veterans we met today. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2041998346437771417",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T21:55:18+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019ll stand for Ohio\u2019s farmers &amp; Lake Erie water quality at the same time. Same goes for expanded tourism &amp; local quality of life. Economic health &amp; ecological health aren\u2019t in tension, they actually go together if we do it right.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2041949221482590675",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:40:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
